          "expr": "sum by (name) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name!=\"\"}[5m])) / on (name) (sum by (name) (container_spec_cpu_quota{name!=\"\"} > 0) / on (name) sum by (name) (container_spec_cpu_period{name!=\"\"}))",
