          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Container CPU Usage",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "CPU used / CPU limit (quota/period). The old expression divided by quota AND period (x/q/p), which is ~1e-10. Containers without a CPU limit are omitted."
